   1940  fca6				   ExitEdgeTab
   1941  fca6		       84 00 9f 04	      .byte.b	PLAYER_MAX_Y, PLAYER_MIN_Y, PLAYER_MAX_X, PLAYER_MIN_X
   1942  fcaa
