   2063  fd26							; calibrated SetObjectXPos arg (S6b: arg A
   2064  fd26							; draws clocks [A-7, A]; right_col c occupies
   2065  fd26							; [80+8c, 87+8c]). PHMOverlay recomputes this
   2066  fd26							; value independently (:1992) — the two MUST
   2067  fd26							; agree or the stripe draws beside its own
   2068  fd26							; collision cell (was #86 = +7px ≈ one cell
   2069  fd26							; right; user-spotted 2026-10-12).
